WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.962 --> 00:00:14.923
landed on another mountain peak.

2
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:19.207
The monkey groaned.

3
00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:23.210
"That fire and smoke were awful!

4
00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:29.356
And the sand went right in—ah-ah-choo!—my nose."

5
00:00:30.676 --> 00:00:33.037
He looked at the Demon of Power's mountain.

6
00:00:33.777 --> 00:00:35.818
The fire and smoke were now gone.

7
00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:39.100
was about to return to that mountain.

8
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.321
But then he hesitated.

9
00:00:43.461 --> 00:00:46.723
"The demon will just use the same trick again," thought the monkey.

10
00:00:46.743 --> 00:00:49.224
"I'll sneak into his cave and look around.

11
00:00:50.304 --> 00:00:53.565
Maybe I can find out how he created the fire, smoke, and sand."

12
00:00:55.686 --> 00:00:59.588
Wukong turned into a bug and flew back to the demon's mountain.

13
00:01:05.016 --> 00:01:09.078
He went into the cave and flew down a long, dark tunnel.

14
00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:17.682
He soon found a brightly lit bedroom filled with nice furniture and fancy decorations.

15
00:01:19.382 --> 00:01:21.583
a corner a woman sat in a chair.

16
00:01:22.964 --> 00:01:23.744
She was crying.

17
00:01:26.225 --> 00:01:28.186
Wukong turned back into himself.

18
00:01:28.206 --> 00:01:30.507
"Oh!" cried the woman.

19
00:01:30.527 --> 00:01:32.108
"Wh-who are you?"

20
00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:35.830
name is Sun Wukong," said the monkey.

21
00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.311
"Are you the queen?"

22
00:01:38.392 --> 00:01:39.253
The woman nodded.

23
00:01:39.273 --> 00:01:43.416
"Your husband sent me to rescue you," said Wukong.

24
00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:46.838
The queen's face broke into a smile.

25
00:01:47.959 --> 00:01:48.599
please do!

26
00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:53.703
The demon who kidnapped me is horrible—nasty, ugly, smelly!"

27
00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:55.685
queen shivered.

28
00:01:55.705 --> 00:02:00.992
"He said he loves me and wants to m-marry me!"

29
00:02:01.193 --> 00:02:03.034
The queen started to cry again.

30
00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:06.577
worry, Your Majesty," said Wukong.

31
00:02:07.117 --> 00:02:07.998
"I'll defeat the demon.

32
00:02:08.799 --> 00:02:12.642
But first I must figure out how he creates the fire, smoke, and sand."

33
00:02:12.662 --> 00:02:14.443
"That's simple."

34
00:02:14.843 --> 00:02:15.844
The queen sniffed.

35
00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:17.846
has three bells.

36
00:02:18.606 --> 00:02:20.088
The first bell makes fire.

37
00:02:21.028 --> 00:02:22.369
second bell makes smoke.

38
00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:25.012
And the third bell makes sand."

39
00:02:26.553 --> 00:02:28.334
saw the bells," said Wukong.

40
00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:31.080
"He wears them around his neck."

41
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.101
monkey smiled.

42
00:02:32.121 --> 00:02:33.602
"You wait here, Your Majesty.

43
00:02:34.422 --> 00:02:36.563
Tonight I'll steal those bells from the demon.

44
00:02:37.304 --> 00:02:39.865
Once I defeat him, I'll come back and rescue you."

45
00:02:41.086 --> 00:02:44.728
The monkey turned back into a bug and flew down another tunnel.

46
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.711
he found a second bedroom.

47
00:02:52.732 --> 00:02:54.553
This one was dark and gloomy.

48
00:02:54.613 --> 00:02:58.816
"This must be the demon's bedroom," thought Wukong.

49
00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.621
"I'll wait here until the demon goes to sleep."

50
00:03:04.421 --> 00:03:06.162
He landed on the ceiling and waited.

51
00:03:08.362 --> 00:03:11.984
A little while later, the Demon of Power came into the room.

52
00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:16.045
Wukong could see the bells tied around the demon's neck.

53
00:03:16.065 --> 00:03:19.246
"What a busy day," said the demon.

54
00:03:19.266 --> 00:03:21.226
"I'm tired."

55
00:03:24.987 --> 00:03:27.588
demon climbed into bed and closed his eyes.

56
00:03:29.232 --> 00:03:31.013
Soon he was snoring loudly.

57
00:03:32.354 --> 00:03:34.256
Wukong turned back into himself.

58
00:03:35.476 --> 00:03:39.059
He plucked a few of his hairs and turned them into fleas.

59
00:03:41.441 --> 00:03:44.763
The fleas landed on the demon's neck and began biting.

60
00:03:45.503 --> 00:03:48.145
The demon scratched at his neck and rolled over.

61
00:03:49.226 --> 00:03:51.548
he scratched some more—and more.

62
00:03:52.508 --> 00:03:54.950
Finally the demon sat up.

63
00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.971
"Why is my neck so itchy?"

64
00:03:57.211 --> 00:03:57.612
he said.

65
00:03:59.532 --> 00:04:00.493
it's these bells.

66
00:04:01.414 --> 00:04:03.135
I'll take them off while I sleep."

67
00:04:04.216 --> 00:04:06.778
The demon laid the three bells on a table.

68
00:04:07.739 --> 00:04:09.781
A few minutes later he was snoring again.

69
00:04:11.142 --> 00:04:14.685
The fleas turned back into hairs and returned to Wukong.

70
00:04:15.926 --> 00:04:19.489
Next the monkey turned the hairs into three fake bells.

71
00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:24.714
He put them on the table and stuck the real bells in his robe.

72
00:04:25.714 --> 00:04:27.296
He looked at the sleeping demon.

73
00:04:28.308 --> 00:04:31.851
"It's too dangerous to use these bells inside," thought the monkey.

74
00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:35.394
"I'll get the demon to come outside, and then I'll fight him."

75
00:04:37.856 --> 00:04:40.819
Wukong became invisible and ran back through the tunnel.

76
00:04:43.481 --> 00:04:45.843
guard was sleeping next to the cave entrance.

77
00:04:47.584 --> 00:04:49.066
Wukong sneaked past him.

78
00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.172
Once he was outside, the monkey shouted.

79
00:04:58.249 --> 00:04:59.471
the queen right now!

80
00:05:00.332 --> 00:05:02.816
If you don't, I'll smash your entire
